About

    This directory contains a number of Makefiles specific to my patches (patch/tepper), in addition to the standard Makefile.
    The NML files in patch/tepper/namelist indicate in their header which Makefile is appropriate to use when running the corresponding simulation.

Test cases

    Makefile_AGAMA_MULTIPATCH with model agama_std
    Makefile_AGAMA_INTERFACE_MULTIPATCH with model agama_inter
    Makefile_AGAMA_DICE_MULTIPATCH with model hbd_26_hyb
    Makefile_AGAMA_INTERFACE_DICE_MULTIPATCH with model hbd_26_hyb
    Makefile_3D_GNU_OLDMPI0_OAGERTZ_DICEPATCH with model hizb_07_lr_fgas20_star
